Error [jet.BreakingChangeNotMajor]: Publishing 1.1.0 after 1.0.0 is a minor bump but breaks the public API item `Receipt`
 Why: A minor bump promises callers no breaking changes, but the public API changed since 1.0.0
 Fix: Bump to 2.0.0 (a major release), or restore `Receipt` (a deprecated shim counts); `--force` publishes anyway with a warning banner.
  public cap `Receipt` changed signature
   | was: cap Receipt #FX(IO, !FS)
   | now: cap Receipt #FX(IO, Net, !FS)
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1218
